 ## Unreleased
 
 - `clinic handover` prints the evening note for the next open day.
+- Cancellations with less than `cancellation_notice_hours` (default 24) to go are recorded as `late_cancelled`.
 - New `buffer_minutes` setting, default 5: free slots leave that gap after every appointment.
 - The exported day schedule writes start and end times on a 12-hour clock (`%I:%M %p`, e.g. `02:00 PM`).
 
